      "id": "post-1774305806973",
      "title": "Tryouts – Late August",
      "body": "Tryouts are typically held the week before school starts. Many other schools and teams already have a head start, as their seasons begin earlier.\n\nWe expect to hold two days of tryouts, with teams finalized the following week so we can prepare for our first games.",
      "date": "March 23, 2026"
    },
